 "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001726_348869887225468_2871228655726821519_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fLT-7PuqP80Q7kNvwGlPbvP&_nc_oc=AdnZo579y9WdCmN5-Ked9a26OFYUxnje4VNGdnBXga1S9HLtYziOTGhGrXrNFY6MCQE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftDAIZoiPrJOhwikOMh7t5IXak_S1TOmpZgQsW5S4uxRg&oe=69A58E57"}]}, "id": "27134390802840875", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20240918-104424-16-9.png", "id": "499492686293545", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031612_499492689626878_6372511981208287760_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ITYuq1wd-lMQ7kNvwHBiu0L&_nc_oc=Adk5Xjf1FymUqOAKceJ889YIjk3qtUCG5muIfX04TdYv0em7EGLYJbfC4wGmUz-rR2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftpFWhz2uAX1o7D3gOuQwWCj8Fp80OsH3vci7YvibHUzw&oe=69A59B87"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20240918-104919-16-9.png", "id": "432221772740034", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003244_432221776073367_2817356410933122245_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jvO7bzD79coQ7kNvwGFOSPV&_nc_oc=AdnE4ZvW1z1z5eyhwil6kzZOFrgbdraTG6uJjK5WoHCcXqCYfuFLqvQW5MhGL6t8Ws0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsjiMzQG8LabG3_WIUsIWlTW5V61Fl0oiAq5poc4AReWg&oe=69A57283"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20240918-172151-16-9.png", "id": "525943766800804", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001686_525943770134137_7010552549987315403_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2pZpgmpHdSgQ7kNvwGeKUTJ&_nc_oc=Adk_rfO29YzuPoZ_sgAX3-r-1HsJWCMju8Y2MTpPhIIRlFn9i749n30LYlPQIPHYKoM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvrW4HYUvCyOT0Seg_UUnX0J00sleHrdjnbGJoWKcMUYQ&oe=69A574CE"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20240918-103648-16-9.png", "id": "1038004147626815", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036653_1038004150960148_6975583511713956111_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CLY1SZx3YcIQ7kNvwEASYU4&_nc_oc=AdmRlM5aC40vRmvyggDu1kItXyKEdrLe0FZL5uF66Ea1ZcdUo56f44p6szxL5MDy12s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv-xMcuRQF0ay_wZ4waKNymDXwmEGeyu5uScWAEO8lVgQ&oe=69A59C24"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20240918-103507-16-9.png", "id": "569453585752182", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974667_569453589085515_5940168554369537433_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cBhs5Y9e5OAQ7kNvwHjBSsl&_nc_oc=AdmJX6BzNZh--CG4AaYaHc4QiZgnzEXATBwiqVHTjQXi803r1iBIE3G7ruE0z9DOHFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftShQXPVBNX2BANKKEQ98JLr7xfokCqOYHRGM4IR09JjA&oe=69A5960E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PostOculusStore_Volleggball.png", "id": "3722721384723693", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974611_3722721391390359_3140296778754052086_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eUj6fQLF1fEQ7kNvwFGcxb1&_nc_oc=AdnbsV_siWL5Unwevmuw9Q1OCLbsVm8r7OegXJXOxvSQV6QBnFtZd9y1I-cb_66I6rQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft_koH9WvwlNUlpFPY8XU46i1oKRLnAj1WY7WssV92hHg&oe=69A5984D"}, "display_name": "Volleggball", "keywords": ["volleyball", "sport", "competitive", "multiplayer", "volley"], "long_description": "# \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udfd0\ud83e\udd5a Spike before you get cooked ! \ud83e\udd5a\ud83c\udfd0\ud83d\udd25\n\nGet ready to crack up with Volleggball, the egg-citing volleyball game that'll have you jump for victory! \n\nThis yolk-tastic multiplayer experience is no chicken feed \u2013 it's a shell-shocking adventure that'll keep you coming back for more!\n\n{1045102036463669}\n\n## \ud83d\udc23 Scramble with your friends\ud83d\udc23 \n\nJump into open lobbies and get cracking with players from around the globe!\n\n## \ud83d\udc50 Sunny-side up gameplay \ud83d\udc50\n\nChoose between 1vs1 or 2vs2 matches for the perfect serving of competition\n\n## \ud83e\udd5aHilarious AI Opponents\ud83e\udd5a\n\nFace off against funny, clumsy egg bots that'll keep you laughing as you play\n\n## \ud83d\ude0e Egg-spressive customization \ud83d\ude0e \n\nStand out from the carton with dozens of ways to personalize your egg-vatar\n\n## \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Eggs-quisite environments \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\n\nSpike your way through 4 egg-mazing maps: \n- Tropical Island Paradise\n- Autumn Lake Splendor\n- Winter Mountain Wonderland\n- Volcanic Inferno (careful not to get poached!)\n\n\ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udfd0\ud83e\udd5a\n\nWhether you're a seasoned pro or just out of your shell, Volleggball offers an egg-citing VR experience that's no yolk! So don't chicken out \u2013 grab your friends and get ready to scramble the competition in this egg-ceptional volleyball adventure!\n\n\ud83e\udd5a\ud83c\udfd0\ud83d\udd25\n\n---\n\ud83c\udf99\ufe0fChat with us on our discord ! https://discord.gg/NvRjfSnmma\n", "short_description": "Best volleyball game in the egg world!\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "PostOculusStore_FreeToPlay.png", "id": "844627027575279", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75297582_844627030908612_100519495280906896_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9Nxa1ZU4hkgQ7kNvwEMEvJr&_nc_oc=AdmeMxLw0BpPLz95KYl11ZhfZfCjdCebtdTCo8c4uq-iEb5nlMDHtA3LG8gCUF0OUVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftg5Ojk5jM8MDfMh_uVgos6D_wGDpfMiDexADn07y3_cw&oe=69A5836D"}]}, "id": "505018882335185", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Volleggball", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udfd0\ud83e\udd5a Smashez avant d'\u00eatre cuit ! \ud83e\udd5a\ud83c\udfd0\ud83d\udd25\n\nPr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 vous fendre la coquille avec Volleggball, le jeu de volleyball qui vous fera sauter d'oeuf-orie ! \n\nCette eggsp\u00e9rience multijoueur n'est pas pour les poules mouill\u00e9es - c'est une aventure digne des meilleurs omelettes qui vous donnera envie d'y revenir encore et encore !\n\n{844627027575279}\n\n## \ud83d\udc23 Mettez tous vos amis dans le m\u00eame panier \ud83d\udc23 \n\nRejoignez des parties ouvertes et amusez-vous avec des joueurs du monde oeuf-tier, sans vous brouiller (ou pas) !\n\n## \ud83d\udc50 Un gameplay \u00e0 la coque \ud83d\udc50\n\nChoisissez entre des matchs simple ou doubles pour une dose parfaite de comp-oeuf-tition.\n\n## \ud83e\udd5aDes adversaires IA coquasse\ud83e\udd5a\n\nAffrontez des rob\u0153ufs dr\u00f4les et maladroits qui vous feront rire \u00e0 vous en secouer le jaune.\n\n## \ud83d\ude0e Personnalisations \u0153ufs-riginales\ud83d\ude0e \n\nD\u00e9marquez-vous avec des dizaines de fa\u00e7ons de personnaliser votre avacoque.\n\n## \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Environnements coquetiers\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f \n\nFaites des smashes \u00e0 travers 4 cartes incroyables :\n- Paradis tropical\n- Splendeur automnale au bord du lac\n- Merveille hivernale en montagne\n- Enfer volcanique (attention \u00e0 ne pas vous faire cuire !)\n\n\ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udfd0\ud83e\udd5a\n\nQue vous soyez un pro aguerri ou un d\u00e9butant, Volleggball offre une exp\u00e9rience de volleyball egg-citante qui va vous endurcir le blanc ! Alors ne marchez pas sur des oeufs - attrapez vos amis et pr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 battre la concurrence dans cette aventure de volleyball egg-ceptionnelle !\n\n\ud83e\udd5a\ud83c\udfd0\ud83d\udd25\n\n---\n\ud83c\udf99\ufe0fDiscutez avec nous sur notre Discord !\nhttps://discord.gg/NvRjfSnmma\n\n", "short_description": "Le meilleur joeuf de volleyball dans ce monde \u00e0 la coque"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pinkmarmotstudios.com/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pink Marmot Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pinkmarmotstudios.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "SIMULATION", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "8106559496133107"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1421672541637223_4430522060750231209_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FNr6RHu0jToQ7kNvwGY_ozD&_nc_oc=AdkxVD_MpgFhxJy_EeFJch4fPZ1g_Csm57CjILvX1r_BHHU6ggjboYCYihv-xk5V9xE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfunO5-rVHT_91RMBNVfordGG8bIsc8a0nPghZsKiIa6CA&oe=69A59F29"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Volleggball", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Sports", "id": "2776542286000603"}, {"topic_name": "Simulation", "id": "331529188132278"}], "release_date": 1627928575, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "514462589869978", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "3910010955788003", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1259746821094145"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "3222872037998297", "